  "introduction": "DUA E NUDBAH\n\nIt is recommended to say this supplication on the four feast days; namely, the ‘Id al-Fitr day (1st of Shawwal), the ‘Id al-Azha day (10th of Dhu’l-Hijjah), the ‘Id al-Ghadir day (18th of Du’l-Hijjah), and Fridays.\n\nThis supplication is as follows:\n\nYou may then offer the prayer of ziyarah, as has been previously described. After that, you may pray Almighty Allah for any thing you wish, and it will be granted for you, Allah willing.",
  "versesCount": 362,
  "verses": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "arabic": "اَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "arabic": "وَ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلٰی سَیِّدِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ نَبِیِّهٖ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "arabic": "وَ اٰلِهٖ وَ سَلَّمَ تَسْلِیْمًا",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "arabic": "اَللّٰھُمَّ لَكَ الْحَمْدُ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "arabic": "عَلٰی مَا جَرٰی بِهٖ قَضَاۤئُكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "arabic": "فِیۤ اَوْلِیَاۤئِكَ الَّذِیْنَ اسْتَخْلَصْتَھُمْ لِنَفْسِكَ وَ دِیْنِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "arabic": "اِذِ اخْتَرْتَ لَھُمْ جَزِیْلَ مَا عِنْدَكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "arabic": "مِنَ النَّعِیْمِ الْمُقِیْمِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "arabic": "الَّذِیْ لَا زَوَالَ لَهٗ وَ لَا اضْمِحْلَالَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "arabic": "بَعْدَ اَنْ شَرَطْتَ عَلَیْھِمُ الزُّھْدَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "arabic": "فِیْ دَرَجَاتِ ھٰذِهِ الدُّنْیَا الدَّنِیَّۃِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "arabic": "وَ زُخْرُفِھَا وَ زِبْرِجِھَا",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "arabic": "فَشَرَطُوْا لَكَ ذٰلِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "arabic": "وَ عَلِمْتَ مِنْھُمُ الْوَفَاۤءَبِهٖ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "arabic": "فَقَبِلْتَھُمْ وَ قَرَّبْتَھُمْ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "arabic": "وَ قَدَّمْتَ لَھُمُ الذِّكْرَ الْعَلِیَّ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "arabic": "وَ الثَّنَاۤءَالْجَلِیَّ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "arabic": "وَ اَھْبَطْتَ عَلَیْھِمْ مَلٰۤئِكَتِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "arabic": "وَ كَرَّمْتَھُمْ بِوَحْیِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "arabic": "وَ رَفَدْتَھُمْ بِعِلْمِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "arabic": "وَ جَعَلْتَھُمُ الذَّرِیْعَۃَ اِلَیْكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
